SUMMARY:[Natural Language Processing & LLMs][LLM Agents & Tool Use] NAACL 2
 027 - ARR paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference of the Nations of the Americas Cha
 pter of the Association for Computational Linguistics\nWebsite: https://2
 027.naacl.org/\nSource URL: https://2027.naacl.org/calls/main_conference_
 papers/\nLocation: San Francisco\, California\, USA\nTopics: Natural Lang
 uage Processing & LLMs\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\, Information Retrieval & 
 Search\, Deep Representation Learning\nSize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-b
 ased\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Former
 ly North American Chapter\; retains NAACL acronym. Shares October ARR cyc
 le with COLING\, but authors may commit to only one primary venue. Commit
 ment is not a fresh-paper route. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: L
 anguage technologies and computational linguistics across the Americas co
 mmunity\, covering multilingual and low-resource NLP\, language models\, 
 dialogue\, retrieval\, evaluation\, and linguistic analysis. The 2027 the
 me concerns language as a medium for agentic communication\, not merely r
 unning multiple models. General application domains are not standalone sp
 ecialist tags.\nAdditional topics: Autonomous Agents & Multiagent Systems
 \, Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\, Fairness & Responsible A
 I\, Robustness & Safety\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nScope source
 s (2027): https://2027.naacl.org/calls/main_conference_papers/\nScope las
 t checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://2027.naacl.org/calls/main_conference_papers/
